{
  "@context": {
    "rdf": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#",
    "rdfs": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#",
    "owl": "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#",
    "label": {
      "@id": "rdfs:label",
      "@container": "@language"
    },
    "comment": {
      "@id": "rdfs:comment",
      "@container": "@language"
    },
    "subClassOf": {
      "@id": "rdfs:subClassOf",
      "@type": "@id"
    },
    "isDefinedBy": {
      "@id": "rdfs:isDefinedBy",
      "@type": "@id"
    },
    "seeAlso": {
      "@id": "rdfs:seeAlso",
      "@type": "@id"
    },
    "versionInfo": "owl:versionInfo"
  },
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/",
      "@type": "owl:Ontology",
      "label": {
        "ja": "交通",
        "en": "Transportation"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "道路と交通のデータです。国の基準（警察庁の交通規制情報の標準フォーマット、国土交通省の道路情報提供システム）に基づいています。",
        "en": "Data about roads and traffic, based on national standards (the National Police Agency's traffic regulation data format and MLIT's Road Information Provision System)."
      },
      "versionInfo": "1.0.0",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/context/transportation/v1.0.0.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/RoadRestriction",
      "@type": "rdfs:Class",
      "label": {
        "ja": "通行規制",
        "en": "Road restriction"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "通行規制（通行止めを含む）1 件のデータです。路線名、規制区間（点、線、面）、状態、区分、期間を持ちます。",
        "en": "One road restriction, including closures: road name, regulated section (point, line or area), status, category and period."
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/transportation/RoadRestriction/"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/regulationCategory",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "regulationCategory"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "規制区分。国土交通省の道路情報提供システムの凡例に合わせています（表記はサイトの凡例のまま）：closedWeather（通行止(異常気象等)）、closedConstruction（通行止(工事)）、closedHeavyVehicle（大型通行止）、closedWinter（冬期通行止）、laneRestriction（車線規制）、alternatingOneWay（片側交互通行）、mobileRestriction（移動規制）、chainRestriction（チェーン規制）、chainGuidance（チェーン指導）、other（その他規制）。closedWeather には、土砂崩落や路肩決壊など災害による通行止めも含みます。任意の属性です。",
        "en": "Regulation category, from the legend of MLIT's Road Information Provision System: closedWeather, closedConstruction, closedHeavyVehicle, closedWinter, laneRestriction, alternatingOneWay, mobileRestriction, chainRestriction, chainGuidance, other. closedWeather also covers closures after a disaster, such as a landslide or a collapsed road shoulder. Optional"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/transportation/RoadRestriction/#regulationCategory"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/restrictionLength",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "restrictionLength"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "線規制の規制区間の延長（メートル）。警察庁「交通規制情報（拡張版標準フォーマット）」の距離・延長（項目 133）と、EEI の距離・延長にあたります。ジオメトリを簡略化していても、延長がわかります。",
        "en": "Length of the regulated section in metres, for a line. The NPA format's 距離・延長 (item 133) and EEI's 距離・延長; known even when the geometry is simplified"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/transportation/RoadRestriction/#restrictionLength"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/restrictionStatus",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "restrictionStatus"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "正規化した状態。値は Smart Data Models の RoadSegment.status と同じです：closed（通行不可）、limited（片側通行など）、open（解除済み、または未実施）。現場での呼び方は statusLabel に、より細かい区分は regulationCategory に書きます。合う値がないときは省き、statusLabel だけを送ります。",
        "en": "Normalised restriction state, the value space of Smart Data Models RoadSegment.status: closed (no traffic), limited (traffic possible but not in full capacity), open (restriction lifted or not yet in place). The local wording goes in statusLabel; a finer public-sector category goes in regulationCategory. When no value fits, leave it out and send only statusLabel"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/transportation/RoadRestriction/#restrictionStatus"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/roadType",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "roadType"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "道路法第 3 条の道路の種類：expressway（高速自動車国道）、nationalRoad（一般国道）、prefecturalRoad（都道府県道）、municipalRoad（市町村道）、other（農道、林道、私道など、道路法の道路でないもの）。自動車専用道路は道路の種類ではなく指定なので、その道路の種類を入れます。",
        "en": "Road class by the Road Act (Art. 3): expressway, nationalRoad, prefecturalRoad, municipalRoad, or other for a road outside the Act (farm, forest or private road). A motorway designation (自動車専用道路) is not a class: give the class of the road it is on"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/transportation/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/transportation/RoadRestriction/#roadType"
    }
  ]
}
